{
  "id": "GAL.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Galatia 5",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristo atén tina gweér baraá lawaali'iimaaro as atén tawa hootaan ar adór múk lawaaleerooká. Gawaá adoorihe sihhiité', ma ya/aamara' tunduwa malé tseegi baraá lawaali'iima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iia qaasaak, anuú Paulo gár ni oo' a tí! Kuungá' burtunda al/utlín, Kristo gár nuwa bui i káhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án /aymuuwí ngu malé inkií/ nee nguri gawdeés, umuúqo heewo oo taa al/uútl, gár kuwa hariím a hara'aya sleémeero gan boo/ees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' bar gan'amuú leelehhitá' ar hara'aya kawa eeharahada', kuungá' taa qaroó partlé' dír Kristowo, nee aga quutlé' dír gurtleemuú Munguhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala atén, harahhifoorén a Mungú ti gan'amií harafaar. Gaarí an gár ta daamaaramaan ar haratlintaao ar /uuruú Qeeruú Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma hee barnaxes i baraá Kristo Yesu, dirose al/utlo a gaarooká, laqaá tam kwa al/utliiká a gaarooká. Ala gár afhhamít a haratlintaao, tidá' ti laqaqaam ar sla'aari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' ana kumité' ar adór hhoo' baraá slafingwhúng oo Krishanu'uumaro. Ala heé kuungá' naa ilaa/ a heemá, tawa kumita', looeema kiwa iialooeemisa'? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala heé adoorí gaa tleehh a Munguheeká, kudá' kuungá' nu ateetiím. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadaádá' mikaáte ir sluufasluf tam ka niiná, aqo /aarmoó yangaariiír sleeme gu sluuftís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén sleémeero a wak baraá Aakoowo. Gawaá adoorihe aníng kuungá' nu xurumitaaká, ala gár ni xuu' a tí, kuungá' sleeme axweesante'eé' tí a siaasia'aaká. Ala heedaádá' kuungá' nu sagaqwaareés, sakwasleemaarós ga sláy, inós tam heemahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala hhaee'eé', án barnaxes kángw al/utlo un alki/iít tawa gár hariím, ala waáy, án misti slahh'eemiis? Ala án geeraawo bar kángw al/utlo un alki/iít adór ir hariín, geera alók heé dukuutsmo i slay i kaahh gawaá alki/ituueé' daanduú msalaábaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukwí kuungá' nu tlaahhír i qamiím, alók masók tin kilooín tuu'utiyá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá', hhaee'eé', kuungá' tunduna ateét as tawa hota' ar amohhooa. Ala amohhooarhúng tisíng ma ar hootara' as ilatleerír slaqwa kawa eeharahada'. Ala ti sagadiyuse' ar sla'aari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma hara'aya sleémeero kaa haragaás gawaá hara'ayaarí wák, tí kah, «Inslaawmoowók slaeek adór kuúng tir kilók sla'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' miti a'aawara' tiwa kikihha' nee tiwa tlu'uunda', asma adoorí bara tlehhé', ti kiloohúng hhaamisá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala gár án ni kah a tí, Qeeruú Mungú slafingwhúng ngu geerahaari, daqaní kuungá' nu aleesleemuú i haniis oo kángw slaqwa i sla' kuwa sia'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma slaqwa kángw i ilatleerus a kudá' Qeeru i slaiiká, asma Qeeru nee slaqwa tin tlaampa'aamisiyá', tam kuungá' adoodá' ta sla'a' a aleesleera'aaká tleehhamooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' Qeeru burnu geeraharahaar, daqaní kuungá' hara'aya nu sa waawuti'ii'iindaaká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá slaqwa ki geehhoo', a kuká': Sli'ima, nee tlehhma'aá slasla/aren, nee tsaatu'uuma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee slaqsa'aá mungui kiwa haratlintaati'i, nee da/ari, nee wakaari, nee gila, nee da/i, nee buhhta, nee fola, nee tlaahhi qamiingw, nee partlito, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee tloomatloong, nee oonitime, nee hheehha, nee muruú hatlá' oo nee kwí slaqamiimís sleeme. Adoodá' naa qaroó geerií oó' dirhúngií alé, ngin malé oó', niwa kah, múk adoorí /imaamiís, waawuti'iimár Mungú ga baloó aaliiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala gár Qeeru i laqwaali baraá slafíngw heewo a sla'aari, nee qwala/, nee wayda, nee qitla, nee hhooeema, nee gurhhooa, nee inkihhimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee tsaeema, nee harqoomaay. Gawaá daanduú muruú adór kwihe hara'aya i káhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Kristo Yesu slaqooín gaa kikií' dinkwa nee sla'aarír tlakw ar slaqwa nee ilatleeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qeeru atén taa slafíngw i haniís, gawaá adoorihe hotangwrén Qeeru ngu geerahari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén xirif muwa leelehhiitaán tam atén tiri kiloorén giirimiisaán nee tari tloomatloomaán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
